{"script":"s_1_18_0","des":"送给她的礼物 接取步骤","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]唉……我确实在担心一些事情，不过你们眼里可能是微不足道的小事吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]是这样的，维丝的生日就快要到了，但我不知道要送她什么礼物。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]我和她毕竟是从小一起长大的，连她喜欢什么都不知道也太过分了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]嗯？你说你可以去替我问一下？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]那太好了，非常感谢！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]不过……你可不要说是我问的啊……拜托了。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}